  "body": "I updated to 0.8.4, not yet 0.8.5, as it doesn't appear in the changelog yet.\r\n\r\nThis prevents the node deprecation warnings when you run `yarn build` or similar:\r\n\r\n```\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'cat' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'cd' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'chmod' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'cp' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'dirs' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'pushd' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'popd' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'echo' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'tempdir' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'pwd' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'exec' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'ls' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'find' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'grep' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'head' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'ln' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'mkdir' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'rm' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'mv' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'sed' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'set' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'sort' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'tail' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'test' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'to' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'toEnd' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'touch' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'uniq' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n(node:98762) Warning: Accessing non-existent property 'which' of module exports inside circular dependency\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n  Thanks for submitting a pull request!\r\n  Please provide enough information so that others can review your pull request.\r\n-->\r\n",
